se mode, I have this output:\r\n```\r\n  astro:router findPathItemByKey() - Unexpected cache miss looking for \"/email/confirm/ab-cd-efg/\" +2m\r\n  astro:router findPathItemByKey() - Unexpected cache miss looking for \"/email/confirm/ab-cd-efg/\" +1ms\r\nA\r\nB\r\nab-cd-efg\r\n```","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/withastro/astro/issues/comments/1960533125/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/withastro/astro/issues/comments/1995828870","html_url":"https://github.com/withastro/astro/issues/8516#issuecomment-1995828870","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/withastro/astro/issues/8516","id":1995828870,"node_id":"IC_kwDOFL76Q8529e6G","user":{"login":"brokeboiflex","id":50945071,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUwOTQ1MDcx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/50945071?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/brokeboiflex","html_url":"https://github.com/brokeboiflex","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brokeboiflex/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brokeboiflex/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brokeboiflex/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brokeboiflex/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brokeboiflex/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brokeboiflex/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brokeboiflex/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brokeboiflex/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brokeboiflex/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-03-13T21:10:22Z","updated_at":"2024-03-15T07:42:35Z","body":"![8j5nlz](https://github.com/withastro/astro/assets/50945071/69f2ac5e